.SH NAME
mouser\-mcp\-enable \- Turn the server on (loopback HTTP; `\-\-https` adds TLS with a self\-signed or your cert)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmouser mcp enable\fR [\fB\-\-https\fR] [\fB\-\-port\fR] [\fB\-\-https\-port\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Turn the server on (loopback HTTP; `\-\-https` adds TLS with a self\-signed or your cert)
